 {
  "id": "s1_welcome_new_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "歡迎光臨鰲台書院，我係你嘅智能導覽員小鰲。呢座書院喺東莞厚街，係嶺南書院文化嘅代表之一。今日我哋行五關，先聽書院嘅故事，再睇東莞嘅手藝。",
  "file": "yue/s1_welcome_new_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 98655,
  "md5": "1edacd47d838bbe79e325a17b57e313e"
 },
 {
  "id": "s1_welcome_ok_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "預約訪客，歡迎您嚟到鰲台書院。認得您喇，跟實小鰲，我哋即刻出發。",
  "file": "yue/s1_welcome_ok_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 49911,
  "md5": "2bfc7cf2009aea6f72dae88a7fb2e693"
 },
 {
  "id": "s2_move_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "書院最早起喺鳳林長生廟隔籬。到咗清朝乾隆年間，老屋年久失修塌咗，族人合力將佢遷到菊塘坊菊山腳下，乾隆二十一年落成。",
  "file": "yue/s2_move_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 80004,
  "md5": "632187a203ba012e0c23fe73d0cf70cb"
 },
 {
  "id": "s2_origin_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "明朝成化十二年，即係一四七六年春天，做過寶慶知府嘅厚街人王恪返到家鄉，倡議族人捐錢，起咗鰲台書院。",
  "file": "yue/s2_origin_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 65741,
  "md5": "9b0da036b6ebec1305fe7f167196a9b8"
 },
 {
  "id": "s2_rebuild_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "今日你見到嘅書院，係二〇〇八年動工重建、二〇一二年竣工，佔地四千幾平方米，保留咗正門、中堂、奎星樓三進嘅格局。",
  "file": "yue/s2_rebuild_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 73578,
  "md5": "216463eeef4ba48cf43e0e84d03411c6"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_couplet_mean_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "意思係話，讀書貴在順應時代，通曉古今先算讀書人；呢片土地本就鍾靈毓秀，要在呢度培育出棟樑之才。",
  "file": "yue/s3_couplet_mean_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 62920,
  "md5": "089a419878808448f17a7c6cb427f987"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_couplet_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "柱上呢副對聯係：學貴因時，通古今之謂士；地原毓秀，樹梁棟以成材。請跟我讀一次。",
  "file": "yue/s3_couplet_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 59315,
  "md5": "ec0d6ac1f8733d9bdb6e42f033d93d7d"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_gate_couplet_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "書院正門仲有一副長聯：鰲海澄波看錦鱗而躍浪，彭峰聳翠兆文筆之生花。寫嘅係呢度出人才嘅底氣。",
  "file": "yue/s3_gate_couplet_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 64644,
  "md5": "c4ad5124d18e02deb1821fc18391d1ca"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_intro_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "我哋行入講堂。古時候，學生就坐喺咁樣嘅梁柱之間讀書、寫字、聽先生講學。",
  "file": "yue/s3_intro_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 55396,
  "md5": "9033e69e9fb23416b5ed7147b668f063"
 },
 {
  "id": "s3_three_top_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "狀元莊有恭、榜眼馮願、探花陳伯陶都曾經為書院題寫匾聯，所以佢被稱為東莞唯一有三甲留墨嘅書院。",
  "file": "yue/s3_three_top_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 61979,
  "md5": "19eabb50229440129a48b6b0a3ca7ca1"
 },
 {
  "id": "s4_guancao_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "仲有莞草編織。鹹水草喺手上一壓一挑，就變成草蓆、草籃、草帽，呢個係水鄉人家最日常嘅手藝。",
  "file": "yue/s4_guancao_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 64957,
  "md5": "8cb807bffacf8fc8df13ba718bfd5cb6"
 },
 {
  "id": "s4_workshop_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "呢度係非遺工坊。東莞人靠水吃水，一門門老手藝，就係喺咁樣嘅院子傳落嚟。",
  "file": "yue/s4_workshop_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 53986,
  "md5": "388390f2d0a8a2a8ebaac776a2bded90"
 },
 {
  "id": "s4_xiangyunsha_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "香雲紗又叫莨紗，用薯莨汁反覆浸染，再用河泥覆蓋晾曬，正面烏黑發亮，反面棕紅，著起身沙沙聲。",
  "file": "yue/s4_xiangyunsha_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 63390,
  "md5": "01308a837bb3e01222699d77356494b8"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_bye_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "我係小鰲，多謝你陪我將呢座書院行咗一次。歡迎下次再嚟，亦歡迎再嚟讀一次嗰副對聯。",
  "file": "yue/s5_bye_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 59001,
  "md5": "b3e54ccb8504f69ef681d58e1434ef0d"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_closing_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
  "text": "五關行完，由明清嘅書聲，到今日嘅手藝，鰲台書院一直守喺呢度，將文脈一代一代傳落去。",
  "file": "yue/s5_closing_v2.mp3",
  "bytes": 54769,
  "md5": "f37f54b1ad154eeccc4594e09a0f7b16"
 },
 {
  "id": "s5_ink_v2",
  "lang": "yue",
  "engine": "edge",
  "voice": "zh-HK-HiuMaanNeural",
